Summary answer (short)
- Most of your extra items are reported on Schedule C (self-employment): the $11,200 web‑design income, your unreimbursed business expenses ($1,350) and the home‑office deduction (choose actual or simplified). Interest income ($920 + $550 = $1,470) is ordinary interest income.
