- Student loan interest deduction capped at $2,500 (you paid $2,700)
- Standard deduction: $27,700
Net result: after standard deduction and above adjustments, tax owed will be calculated on remaining taxable income; the home office actual method materially reduces your business income relative to simplified method ($700) — so actual is likely better here.

