- Federal: You should report the $11,200 web‑design income on Schedule C and pay self‑employment tax on Schedule SE. Your student‑loan interest is an above‑the‑line deduction (but capped at $2,500). The $1,350 charitable gift is only deductible if you itemize; with the information provided you will almost certainly be better off taking the 2023 standard deduction for married filing jointly ($27,700) unless you have other sizable itemizable amounts (mortgage interest, large property tax, large state income tax, big medical expenses, etc.).
