- Unreimbursed expenses: deductible only if they are ordinary and necessary business expenses of your web‑design work (report on Schedule C). Unreimbursed employee expenses for a W‑2 job are not deductible for 2018–2025 (suspended).
- Forms you’ll need (federal): Form 1040, Schedule 1 (adjustments to income), Schedule C (Profit or Loss from Business), Schedule SE (self‑employment tax), Form 8829 if you use actual home‑office method, and Schedule A only if you itemize. Keep W‑2, 1099s/1099‑NEC/1099‑INT, Form 1098‑E (student loan interest), and receipts.

Detailed explanation and numbers (estimates)
