- Schedule A (Itemized Deductions) — only if you decide to itemize instead of the standard deduction
- Keep W‑2, 1099‑NEC or 1099‑MISC (if any), 1099‑INT, 1098‑E, and receipts for all deductions (home rent/utility documents, charity receipts, business receipts).

